<title>POLAND: WBK NOV NET RISES TO PLN 10.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK NOV NET RISES TO PLN 10.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 10.74 vs    8.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   14.29 vs   15.07</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.18 vs   31.91</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	65.77 vs   59.83</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					144.76 vs  107.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  208.08 vs  177.34</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		398.95 vs  330.80</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     730.15 vs  618.25</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
